  "bio": "Thom Rein is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Austin, Texas, who excels in creating 'newschool' and 'illustrative' style tattoos. Commended consistently for his unique artistry, Thom also accepts art commissions and holds an impressive online portfolio. Combining finesse and creativity, Thom uses his tattoo needle with a painter's flair, making him popular among those seeking individualistic and distinctive body art.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Austin, Texas, United States"
